====== COMFAST CF-E120A v3 ======

{{:media:comfast:cfe110nr.jpg?200|CF-E120A right view (image from comfast.com.cn)}}  

The [[http://en.comfast.com.cn/index.php?m=content&c=index&a=show&catid=19&id=23|COMFAST CF-E120A]] is an outdoor 5 GHz wireless CPE. It is based on the [[docs:techref:hardware:soc:soc.qualcomm.ar71xx|Atheros AR9344]] SoC, and features two RJ45 10/100 Mbps Ethernet ports with PoE in and a 300 Mbps 5 GHz 802.11b/g/n radio connected to an internal 2T2R 11 dBi atenna.



